    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think it's just burnout though. it feels more permanent. like the story is actually over. you know when a painting is just... done? and if you add anything else, you just ruin it? i feel like i've reached that point. there's nothing left to paint. it's just quiet now.",
