      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That quiet can feel like an ending, but it's often the space where a new layer of paint needs to dry. A painting isn't ruined by stopping—it's ruined by forcing more onto it before it's ready. You don't have to add anything right now; just let the canvas rest. The story isn't over, it's just between chapters.",
